	"descriptionMarkdown": "Compact rocket-rush starter base (Factorio 2.0, assembling-machine-2, yellow belts). 8 blocks merged into one layout:\n\n- Left column, top to bottom: steam power 10 boilers : 20 engines, electronic circuits 3:2, automation science x5 (+1 gear), logistic science x6 (direct-insertion gear -> inserter / belt), labs x10 chained.\n- Middle: iron mining strip (16 drills) -> 48 stone furnaces, copper mining strip -> 48 stone furnaces. The mining belt lines up with the furnace ore belt.\n- Bottom right: rocket silo with 2 input belts (LDS / processing unit lanes + rocket fuel via long-handed inserter).\n\nNotes: place mining strips on ore patches and attach an offshore pump to the pipe stub left of the boilers. Mixed-lane belts (iron/copper, ore/coal) need side-loading at the merge point. Belts between blocks are intentionally omitted.\n\n한국어: 블록 8개를 배치도대로 합친 것. 왼쪽 열: 증기발전→전자회로→빨강→초록→연구소. 가운데: 철 채굴→철 제련, 구리 채굴→구리 제련. 오른쪽 아래: 로켓 사일로.",
